Title:
ar_m1_r3_nofield - ar m=1 one electron (Tong-Lin SAE); no field (drift)

# Brief 16 (two-photon). Pulse: colours [(9.0, 1000000000000.0)] (eV, W/cm2), FWHM 20.0 fs (intensity), phi2 0.0 fs^2.
# A from the file scaled by peakA = 1.613871287656e-02 au; window [-2480.4824, 3480.4824] au; fixStep 0.015.

#define BOX 80
#define TongLinV (1.0+16.039*exp(-2.007*Q)-25.543*Q*exp(-4.525*Q)+0.961*exp(-0.443*Q))/Q



Axis: name,order,lowerEnd,upperEnd,functions,nElem
 Phi,1,0.,6.28318530718,expIm[1]
 Eta,10,-1,1,assocLegendre{Phi}
